{"5465890":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Just Hearts","steam_appid":5465890,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"Just Hearts brings familiar four-player Hearts to a quiet green felt table. Pick your pass, follow suit, and aim for the lowest score.<br><br>Play offline against three computer opponents. Solo play needs no account.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pass three<\/h2>Choose three cards to send left, right, or across. Every fourth hand, keep the cards you were dealt. A clear fan and traditional card faces help you plan the hand before the two of clubs opens play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/54ff03d9085e8f821fccf2178fe6b28a.poster.avif?t=1793746345\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/54ff03d9085e8f821fccf2178fe6b28a.webm?t=1793746345\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/54ff03d9085e8f821fccf2178fe6b28a.mp4?t=1793746345\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch the queen<\/h2>Each heart costs one point. The queen of spades costs thirteen. Avoid penalty points, or take all twenty-six to shoot the moon: you score zero and each opponent scores twenty-six.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/7488d870ed55a1d140c89aed13adf4ed.poster.avif?t=1793746345\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/7488d870ed55a1d140c89aed13adf4ed.mp4?t=1793746345\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Settle into the game<\/h2>Readable cards, clear turn highlights, and automatic trick collection keep each hand easy to follow. Choose Easy or Standard computer opponents, a 100-point match or a shorter 50-point match, and the pace that feels right.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/e5fa918a3f0fbbd8863b55d83db70224.poster.avif?t=1793746345\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/e5fa918a3f0fbbd8863b55d83db70224.mp4?t=1793746345\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make the table comfortable with your preferred card size, suit order, card back, felt, and background colors.<br><\/li><li>Set card sounds and celebration sounds separately, or mute both.<br><\/li><li>Follow public play with an optional card counter that also highlights the cards in your own hand.<br><\/li><li>Queue a card while waiting. It plays on your turn only if it remains legal.<\/li><\/ul><br>Review individual scores after each hand, or hide the results to look over the table. The lowest total wins; a tie for lowest continues into another hand.<br>","about_the_game":"Just Hearts brings familiar four-player Hearts to a quiet green felt table. Pick your pass, follow suit, and aim for the lowest score.<br><br>Play offline against three computer opponents. Solo play needs no account.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pass three<\/h2>Choose three cards to send left, right, or across. Every fourth hand, keep the cards you were dealt. A clear fan and traditional card faces help you plan the hand before the two of clubs opens play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/54ff03d9085e8f821fccf2178fe6b28a.poster.avif?t=1793746345\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/54ff03d9085e8f821fccf2178fe6b28a.webm?t=1793746345\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/54ff03d9085e8f821fccf2178fe6b28a.mp4?t=1793746345\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch the queen<\/h2>Each heart costs one point. The queen of spades costs thirteen. Avoid penalty points, or take all twenty-six to shoot the moon: you score zero and each opponent scores twenty-six.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/7488d870ed55a1d140c89aed13adf4ed.poster.avif?t=1793746345\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/7488d870ed55a1d140c89aed13adf4ed.mp4?t=1793746345\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Settle into the game<\/h2>Readable cards, clear turn highlights, and automatic trick collection keep each hand easy to follow. Choose Easy or Standard computer opponents, a 100-point match or a shorter 50-point match, and the pace that feels right.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/e5fa918a3f0fbbd8863b55d83db70224.poster.avif?t=1793746345\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/extras\/e5fa918a3f0fbbd8863b55d83db70224.mp4?t=1793746345\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make the table comfortable with your preferred card size, suit order, card back, felt, and background colors.<br><\/li><li>Set card sounds and celebration sounds separately, or mute both.<br><\/li><li>Follow public play with an optional card counter that also highlights the cards in your own hand.<br><\/li><li>Queue a card while waiting. It plays on your turn only if it remains legal.<\/li><\/ul><br>Review individual scores after each hand, or hide the results to look over the table. The lowest total wins; a tie for lowest continues into another hand.<br>","short_description":"Familiar Hearts at a quiet green felt table. Pass three cards, avoid the queen of spades, or shoot the moon. Play offline against three computer opponents with traditional cards, a pace you choose, and a clear view of every trick.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/e71311d100a8ea95c94695975cfefb9db18fc899\/header.jpg?t=1793746345","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/aad0ffc6838d567867646e37225924037c1cd39b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793746345","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5465890\/aad0ffc6838d567867646e37225924037c1cd39b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793746345","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core x86-64 processor with SSE4.2 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3-compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 250 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Mouse and keyboard required. No internet connection required for solo play.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><